Description: Graphical configuration editor for LEDSpicer
 LEDSpicer UI is the visual editor for the LEDSpicer platform. It replaces
 hand-editing XML configuration files with a point-and-click interface for
 designing control-panel layouts, configuring LED hardware, and managing
 profiles and animations for arcade cabinets and interactive projects.
 .
 It can drive a running LEDSpicer daemon to test layouts and lights live, and
 imports and migrates existing projects.
